      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tYour process is important and vital. If you have questions about your
    process, contact your process advisor who has reached out to you.\n \r\n\tWhen
    you have completed your process, leave your current place of residence and relocate
    to a secondary city. Properly dispose of all credit cards & other traceable materials
    before leaving home. Use the cash that has been provided to you to buy a second
    travel fare to Bristol, Vermont. You will spend three days in Bristol to assure
    that your movements have not been traced.\n \r\n\tAfter three days, a Dawn Coordinator
    will meet you at a specified location to verify your identity and escort you
    to our gathering site to complete your initiation.\n\r\n\tThank you for being
    one of us. Together, we will bring about the world as it was dreamt. We look
    forward to seeing you.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
